pose registry (`personalisation`, `taskExecution`, `analytics`, `modelTraining`) or an absolute IRI. The VTA grants it only if the caller\'s ACL entry does — `any` grants every purpose but `modelTraining` — refuses it otherwise (`purposeNotGranted`), and records it in the audit record of the read. Optional where the entry lists exactly one purpose (that one applies) or states `any` (the read is recorded as for no stated purpose).","\$ref":"#/\$defs/Purpose"},"Purpose":{"title":"Purpose","description":"What content is used for: a lowerCamelCase name registered in the VTI specification\'s purpose registry (Appendix H) — `personalisation`, `taskExecution`, `analytics`, `modelTraining` at the time of writing — or an absolute IRI naming a purpose defined elsewhere, such as a purpose of the W3C Data Privacy Vocabulary (`https://w3id.org/dpv#ServicePersonalisation`). Compared by exact string equality: a consumer MUST NOT treat a purpose it does not recognise as equal to any other, and grants only a request naming exactly a listed purpose (VTI-ACL-109). A registered name is never an IRI, because it contains no `:`.","type":"string","maxLength":2048,"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-zA-Z0-9]{0,63}\$"},{"pattern":"^[a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9+.-]*:[^\\\\s]+\$"}]}}}';

/// The SPEC §7.2 policy for the request variant, taken from this
/// specification's front matter.
///
/// Pass it to [consumeInbound] — items 5b, 7 and 8 are per-specification and
/// cannot be derived from the document alone, and item 2 needs the schema it
/// carries.
const SpecPolicy spec = SpecPolicy(
  typeUri: typeUri,
  isBearer: false,
  isProofRequired: false,
  isRecipientRequired: true,
  isIssuedAtRequired: true,
  payloadSchema: payloadSchemaJson,
);

/// The SPEC §7.2 policy for the success-response variant.
///
/// `isRecipientRequired` tracks the *issuer* party's requirement, because a
/// response swaps the parties (§7.3 item 5).
const SpecPolicy responseSpec = SpecPolicy(
  typeUri: responseTypeUri,
  isBearer: false,
  isProofRequired: true,
  isRecipientRequired: true,
  isIssuedAtRequired: true,
  payloadSchema: responsePayloadSchemaJson,
);
